ONE COUNTING NOTE, so a reader is not misled by my own script. The verification script counted lines
matching "^UVM_ERROR" and therefore ALSO counted the UVM Report Summary's own "UVM_ERROR :    2" tally line,
printing errors=3 and errors=6 where the errors are 2 and 5. The measurement script had matched
"^UVM_ERROR [^:]*@", which excludes the tally. The error rows above are the real counts; the raw script
output is retained beside this log and shows the inflated ones.

